# Local IPOs: every value the market uses is an option. The Options page, built as the game
# builds it, has a slider for each: the player's four groups (while Local IPOs is on, and always in
# dev builds) and the finer workings in dev builds. Each label says its value. Reads only; nothing
# is changed.
name local ipos: Options has a slider for every Local IPOs value, each label saying its value
local-ipos on
ipo-options-keep
options-preview on
expect-ipo-options 39
capture ipo-options
# typing a number: kept in range, snapped to its step, nonsense ignored; put back at the end
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel 4
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 4
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel 9
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 5
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel abc
expect-ipo-option ipo.exchangeLevel 5
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares 230
expect-ipo-option ipo.gateSquares 250
# the draw: the largest candidates of a kind by workers, a bigger one likelier
expect-ipo-option ipo.shortlistSize 10
expect-ipo-option ipo.sizeWeightPercent 100
expect-ipo-option ipo.minWorkers 45
ipo-option-type ipo.sizeWeightPercent 55
expect-ipo-option ipo.sizeWeightPercent 60
ipo-option-type ipo.sizeWeightPercent restore
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel restore
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares restore
# quick presets per section, the preset in use, Save as… and Delete
ipo-section Listing Default
ipo-section Candidates Default
ipo-section Prices Default
ipo-section BuyoutsAndClosing Default
expect-ipo-preset Default
ipo-section Listing MoreLikely
expect-ipo-option ipo.maxIposPerYear 4
expect-ipo-preset New Preset
ipo-section Candidates MoreLikely
ipo-section Prices MoreLikely
ipo-section BuyoutsAndClosing MoreLikely
expect-ipo-preset More likely
ipo-section Listing LessLikely
expect-ipo-option ipo.maxIposPerYear 1
ipo-preset-save Default
expect-ipo-preset New Preset
ipo-preset-save Test preset (uitest)
expect-ipo-preset Test preset (uitest)
capture ipo-options-presets
options-preview scroll 1000
capture ipo-options-sections
options-preview scroll 0
ipo-preset-delete
expect-ipo-preset New Preset
ipo-options-put-back
# dev builds show them with Local IPOs off too, so they can be set before switching it on
local-ipos off
options-preview on
expect-ipo-options 39
cleanup:
ipo-options-put-back
ipo-option-type ipo.exchangeLevel restore
ipo-option-type ipo.gateSquares restore
options-preview off
local-ipos restore
